                              "id": "bb225c12-7d39-40ec-aa8d-d1519e1f0831",
                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Which spring\nbelongs in the\nregulator test\nframe? Judge it by\nthe required",
                                  "closing travel,\nnot by polish or\nhow well it\nstores. Rivet will\nask the trainee to",
                                  "repeat your reason\nbefore fitting it.\nA useful\ncorrection should\nleave the next",
                                  "builder\nunderstanding the\npart, rather than\nmerely remembering\nthat a senior",
                                  "person preferred\nit."
                                ],
                                "avatarId": "",
                                "minHeight": 4,
                                "maxHeight": 7,
